<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>User Dashboard - Active Session</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            color: #222222;
            padding: 30px;
        }
        body.dark {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .card {
            max-width: 550px;
            margin: auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }
        body.dark .card {
            background-color: #334155;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            background: #16a34a;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
        }
        .logout-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            background-color: #dc2626;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="<%= theme %>">
    <div class="card">
        <h2>Welcome, <%= user.username %>! <span class="badge">Session Active</span></h2>
        <p>Because HTTP is stateless, the server uses your <strong>Session ID</strong> cookie to remember you across page reloads.</p>

        <ul>
            <li><strong>Role:</strong> <%= user.role %></li>
            <li><strong>Login Time:</strong> <%= user.loginTime %></li>
            <li><strong>Session ID:</strong> <code><%= sessionID %></code></li>
            <li><strong>Dashboard Reloads (Session State):</strong> <%= dashboardViews %></li>
            <li><strong>Active Theme (Browser Cookie):</strong> <%= theme %></li>
        </ul>

        <form action="/set-theme" method="POST" style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <label for="theme">Switch Cookie Theme: </label>
            <select id="theme" name="theme" onchange="this.form.submit()">
                <option value="light" <%= theme === 'light' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Light</option>
                <option value="dark" <%= theme === 'dark' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Dark</option>
            </select>
        </form>

        <a href="/logout" class="logout-btn">Destroy Session (Logout)</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
